* Set RUNNER STATUS to IN_PROGRESS for runners with a time in %1 but no Finish.
* Call once per on-course field (ChipStart, then each split). Each call only
* touches runners whose status is still blank, so the calls act as an OR:
* any one mat read is enough to count as on course.
Select              BIB
>                   0
And
Select              RUNNER STATUS
EQ
And
Select              %1
NE
And
Select              FINISH
EQ
Selected            RUNNER STATUS
Selected Message    IN_PROGRESS
